  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Gianluigi Aponte (Italian pronunciation: [dʒanluˈiːdʒi aˈponte]; born 27 June 1940) is an Italian billionaire businessman, and the co-founder, and chairman of Mediterranean Shipping Company (MSC).\nIn 2026, Forbes estimated Aponte's net worth at $44.5 billion, ranking him as the 43rd-richest person in the world.",
